{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "关于北航《红旗战斗队》在国防科委坚持斗争问题的指示（一九六六年八月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n210)\n关于北航《红旗战斗队》在国防科委坚持斗争问题的指示\n（一九六六年八月）\n不要怕，不要让学生席地而坐，搭起棚子来，让学生闹上三个月。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c03d3a07bd643ae91ecc", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-210.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "4ff32c6db5133ebec105b8ac93a7dab9e3f10794ba3a35106bd02123c0603f3e", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "1864c55f569edb027afc810698318893e815177ca507ca6c469d68f071eb8ba1", "text_chars": 154}
